    "title": "Hard Freezes coming with a weekend strong cold front, ending our growing season. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By No media credit provided. ,\n5 hours ago\n3 more perfect Oklahoma Fall days, then Saturday mid afternoon a strong cold front will move thru the OKC Metro. Look for wind chills in the 20s by Sunday morning and by Monday morning with clear skies and light winds hard freezes will move in. Here are my Metro forecast lows Monday morning November 10th, 2025. Mike #okwx\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KFOR.com Oklahoma City.\n3",
